    lyrics: "(Alright, let's go!)\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's roll… Vamos\nGood vibes… Buenos momentos\nCruising with my amigos.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, buenos días\nWindows down, feel the breeze.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor this perfect day, you see.\nPlease… Por favor\nPass the map, we're on our way.\nGood afternoon… Buenas tardes\nAs the miles roll away.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's roll… Vamos\nGood vibes… Buenos momentos\nCruising with my amigos.\n\n[Verse]\nMusic loud, singing loud\nGood night… Buenas noches\nWhen the stars come out.\nYou're welcome… De nada\nFor the laughs and all the fun.\nGoodbye… Adiós\nUntil the next road we run.\n\n[Bridge]\nWaving hands, saying hi\nHola amigos, hasta luego.\nFeel the rhythm, feel the beat\nVamos, let's keep the journey sweet.\nVery well… Muy bien\nEvery moment, can't you tell?\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's roll… Vamos\nGood vibes… Buenos momentos\nCruising with my amigos.\n\n(Alright, keep it going!)",
    vocab: [{"es":"hola","en":"hello"},{"es":"buenos días","en":"good morning"},{"es":"buenas tardes","en":"good afternoon"},{"es":"buenas noches","en":"good night"},{"es":"¿cómo estás?","en":"how are you?"},{"es":"muy bien","en":"very well"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thank you"},{"es":"por favor","en":"please"},{"es":"de nada","en":"you're welcome"},{"es":"adiós","en":"goodbye"},{"es":"me llamo...","en":"my name is..."},{"es":"soy de...","en":"I am from..."},{"es":"hasta luego","en":"see you later"},{"es":"con permiso","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"lo siento","en":"I'm sorry"}],
