    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "Hey, hey, it's time to party!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?\nFriend… Amigo\nLet's celebrate… ¡Vamos a celebrar!\nBirthday time, let's go.\n\n[Verse]\nBuenas… Good vibes in the air\nSaludo… A greeting everywhere\nAmigo… Friend by my side\nSaluda… Greets with a smile so wide\nEscucha… Listens to the music play\nHabla… Speaks in a cheerful way\nBuenas… Good times all around\nAdiós… Goodbye, but we'll be back around\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?\nFriend… Amigo\nLet's celebrate… ¡Vamos a celebrar!\nBirthday time, let's go.\n\n[Verse]\nPregunta… Asks if I'm having fun\nResponde… I say, \"Yes, under the sun\"\nBuenos días… Good morning turned to night\nBut the party keeps shining bright\nEscucha… Listens to the laughter and cheer\nHabla… Speaks words we all want to hear\nBuenas… Good vibes never fade\nAdiós… Goodbye, but the memories won't fade\n\n[Bridge]\nIn this moment, we're all together\nCelebrating, come sunshine or stormy weather\nWith every \"Hola\" and \"Adiós\"",
    vocab: [{"es":"buenas","en":"good (informal, used as a greeting)"},{"es":"saludo","en":"greeting"},{"es":"amigo","en":"friend"},{"es":"saluda","en":"greets"},{"es":"habla","en":"speaks"},{"es":"escucha","en":"listens"},{"es":"responde","en":"responds"},{"es":"pregunta","en":"asks"},{"es":"buenos días","en":"good morning"},{"es":"¿qué tal?","en":"how's it going?"},{"es":"disculpa","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"cuídate","en":"take care"},{"es":"hasta pronto","en":"see you soon"},{"es":"buenas tardes","en":"good afternoon"},{"es":"amable","en":"kind"}],
