    lyrics: "¡Dale!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola  \nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?  \nLet's talk, let's walk, let's go  \nOne step, two steps, let's flow  \nMeeting new friends today\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, skies are blue  \nWalking up, saying \"Hi… Hola\" to you  \nGreetings… Saludos, that's the word  \nExcuse me… Disculpa, if it's unheard  \nNice to meet you… Encantado, I say  \nWhere are you from?… ¿De dónde eres?  \nFine… Bien, I'm doing great  \nTake care… Cuídate, have a lovely day  \n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?  \nLet's talk, let's walk, let's go  \nOne step, two steps, let's flow  \nMeeting new friends today  \n\n[Verse]  \nGood morning… Buenos días, the sun's shining bright  \nI'm from here… De aquí, and it's a beautiful sight  \nSee you soon… Hasta pronto, that's what we say  \nThank you… Gracias, and you're welcome… De nada, every day  \nWhat's your name?… ¿Cómo te llamas? I ask with a grin  \nFriendly vibes… Buenas ondas, let the fun begin  \n\n[Bridge]  \nWalking through the neighborhood  ",
