    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n¡Ay, qué calorcito!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nGood day… Buenos días\nCome play… Ven a jugar\nSaluda… Greet the sun\nAmable… Kind hearts\nMeet here… Aquí nos encontramos\nVamos a la playa.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, we're on the sand,\nListening to the ocean's band.\nGood morning… Buenos días\nFeeling the breeze today.\nAmable… Kind faces\nEverywhere we go.\nHola… Hello again\nTo friends we know.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nGood day… Buenos días\nCome play… Ven a jugar\nSaluda… Greet the sun\nAmable… Kind hearts\nMeet here… Aquí nos encontramos\nVamos a la playa.\n\n[Verse]\nWhat's your name?… ¿Cuál es tu nombre?\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nPresenta… Introduce yourself\nLet's get to know the crew.\nEscucha… Listen closely\nTo the waves and their song.\nHabla… Speak your mind\nJoin in, come along.\n\n[Bridge]\nThe sun's so bright, it feels right,\nRespuesta… Answer the call.\nPregunta… Ask the waves\nWhat secrets they hold.\nDe nada… You're welcome\nFor this perfect day.\nLet's stay… Quedémonos\nAnd watch the sky turn gray.\n",
