    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "(Hey there, chef!)\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nIn the kitchen, let's cook… En la cocina, vamos a cocinar\nChopping and learning, one, two, three… Cortando y aprendiendo, uno, dos, tres\nLet's make something great today.\n\n[Verse]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nThe sun is up, and so are we.\nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?\nWe're making dinner, just you and me.\nExcuse me… Disculpa\nPass the salt, if you please.\nTake care… Cuídate\nWhile you stir, don't burn your peas.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nIn the kitchen, let's cook… En la cocina, vamos a cocinar\nChopping and learning, one, two, three… Cortando y aprendiendo, uno, dos, tres\nLet's make something great today.\n\n[Verse]\nGood day… Buen día\nThe aroma's filling up the air.\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nCooking with you, it's only fair.\nWhat's your name?… ¿Cómo te llamas?\nI'm Chef, and I'm here to stay.\nSee you soon… Hasta pronto\nAfter dinner, we'll find a way.\n\n[Bridge]\nThank you… Gracias",
