    lyrics: "¡Oye!  \n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar  \nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres  \nFeel the rhythm and sing with me.  \n\n[Verse]  \nMarket's alive, colors so bright  \nBuenas… buenas, it's a beautiful sight.  \n¿Qué tal?… How's it going today?  \nPeople smiling, in every way.  \n\nexcuse me, pardon me… Disculpa  \nI need to find the freshest tea.  \nCuídate… take care, my friend  \nHasta pronto… see you again.  \n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar  \nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres  \nFeel the rhythm and sing with me.  \n\n[Verse]  \n¡Oye! What's your name?… ¿Cómo te llamas?  \nMucho gusto… nice to meet ya.  \nWhere are you from?… ¿De dónde eres?  \n¿Tienes años?… How old are you, my chum?  \n\nThe market's bustling, energy's high  \n¿Qué haces?… What are you doing? Tell me why.  \nFriendly faces, laughter in the air  \nDe nada… you're welcome, it's all good here.  \n\n[Bridge]  ",
