    lyrics: "[Intro]\n¡Dale! Let's go!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's roll… Vamos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nTime to learn, you and me.\n\n[Verse]\nWaking up, it's a brand new day,\nGood morning… Buenos días, let's start this way.\nYes… sí, no… no, let's get it right,\nBuen día, good day, shining bright.\nGetting ready, putting on my shoes,\nEncantado, nice to meet you, that's the news.\n¿Que tal? How's it going? I ask with a grin,\n¿Y tú? And you? Let's dive in.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's roll… Vamos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nTime to learn, you and me.\n\n[Verse]\nOut the door, feeling alive,\nBien, fine, everything's gonna thrive.\nGracias, thank you, for the kindness you show,\nMucho gusto, pleased to meet you, let the friendship grow.\nWalking down the street, feeling so free,\n¿Como te llamas? What's your name? It's you and me.\nHola, hello, I wave to a friend,\nDe nada, you're welcome, let's do it again.\n\n[Bridge]\nIn the classroom, voices ring,",
