    lyrics: "[Intro]\nAlright now...\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Qué tal?  \nShopping for new styles today.  \nVamos… Let's go  \nTry on clothes, feeling so fresh, you know.  \nHere we go.\n\n[Verse]\nWander through the store, so bright…  \nColors everywhere, what a sight.  \nHi… Hola  \nSmiling at the clerk, feeling right.  \nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?  \nLooking for a shirt, I might buy it all.  \nExcuse me… Perdón  \nCan you help me find the fitting room?  \nSorry… Perdona  \nFor taking up your time, it's all good.\n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Qué tal?  \nShopping for new styles today.  \nVamos… Let's go  \nTry on clothes, feeling so fresh, you know.  \nHere we go.\n\n[Verse]  \nFound a dress, it's just my size…  \nTrying it on, it's a pleasant surprise.  \nNice to meet you… Encantado  \nThank you… Gracias  \nFor your help, I really appreciate it.  \nYou're welcome… De nada  \nHave a good day… Buen día  \nWaving goodbye as I walk away.  \nSee you soon… Hasta pronto  \nTake care… Cuídate  ",
