    lyrics: "¡Dale!\n\n[Hook]\nRainy morning… Mañana lluviosa  \nI’m at home… Estoy en casa  \nLet’s learn… Aprendamos  \nEnglish, Spanish… Inglés, español  \nJoin me, let’s go.\n\n[Verse]\nWe… Nosotros  \nSitting by the window, watching the rain fall slow.  \nYou (plural, informal)… Vosotros  \nPlaying games, laughing, time flies, you know.  \nThey (feminine)… Ellas  \nSipping coffee, talking, stories to unfold.  \nYou (plural, formal/informal)… Ustedes  \nJoin the circle, feel the warmth, let the joy take hold.\n\n[Hook]\nRainy morning… Mañana lluviosa  \nI’m at home… Estoy en casa  \nLet’s learn… Aprendamos  \nEnglish, Spanish… Inglés, español  \nJoin me, let’s go.\n\n[Verse]\nThis (masculine)… Este  \nBook in my hand, stories waiting to be read.  \nThat (masculine)… Ese  \nPicture on the wall, memories in my head.  \nHere… Aquí  \nIn this cozy room, where we feel so free.  \nThere… Allí  \nThrough the window, the world’s calling you and me.\n\n[Bridge]\nIt’s the same… Es el mismo  ",
