    lyrics: "¡Arriba!  \n[Hook]  \nRain is falling… Llueve  \nCan't you hear?… ¿No escuchas?  \nStay inside… Quedémonos  \nYou and I… Tú y yo  \nLearn to say it slow.  \n[Verse]  \nGray skies… Cielos grises  \nWhisper secrets in my ear.  \nMine… Mío  \nYours… Tuyo  \nHis, hers, theirs… Suyo  \nWords we need to know.  \nOur little home… Nuestro hogar  \nWarm and bright.  \nYours (plural)… Vuestro  \nAs we dance in candlelight.  \n[Hook]  \nRain is falling… Llueve  \nCan't you hear?… ¿No escuchas?  \nStay inside… Quedémonos  \nYou and I… Tú y yo  \nLearn to say it slow.  \n[Verse]  \nShe laughs… Ella ríe  \nHe smiles… Él sonríe  \nWe (feminine)… Nosotras  \nChasing dreams in our own way.  \nYou (plural, informal)… Vosotros  \nJoin the fun, come and play.  \nYou (plural, formal)… Ustedes  \nWelcome here, feel at ease.  \nI sing… Yo canto  \nTo the rhythm of the breeze.  \n[Bridge]  \nMe and you… Tú y yo  \nUnderneath the rainy skies.  \nSharing stories… Compartiendo historias  \nAs the time flies by.  \n[Hook]  ",
