    lyrics: "[Ad-lib] ¡Vamos, amigos!\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two… Uno, dos\nCounting at the market, here we go.\nThree, four… Tres, cuatro\nLearning numbers, let's explore.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, let's take a stroll,\nfruits and veggies, colors so bright.\nPar… even, impar… odd,\nfinding patterns in the morning light.\nNaranjas… oranges, manzanas… apples,\ncounting with each step we take.\nOrden… order, número… number,\nin this mercado, we'll learn to make.\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two… Uno, dos\nCounting at the market, here we go.\nThree, four… Tres, cuatro\nLearning numbers, let's explore.\n\n[Verse]\nDécimo… tenth, vigésimo… twentieth,\ncounting up, we're on a quest.\nCantidad… quantity, in every stall,\nfrom apples to bananas, we count them all.\nContar… to count, as we wander,\nthrough the aisles, voices like thunder.\nQuince… fifteen, in a line we stand,\nwith each purchase, we understand.\n\n[Bridge]\nTercio… third, cuarto… quarter,\nsharing with friends, we grow bolder.\nIn this market, numbers come alive,",
